#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Pirates - APM Golden"
msgstr "海盗 - 金色手速"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Go infinite with [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] setup, [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] helps to get the ball rolling. With the escapee, you'll play a lot of goldens and discovers, both of which helps with [[Hooktusk, Master Marauder||132925]]. Scale by being infinite and buying discover effects.  ADVANCED PLAYERS: Pivot higher cap which is demons shop buff comp"
msgstr "利用 [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]、[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 和 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 的组合实现无限经济，[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 可以帮助这套体系顺利启动。有了上进的逃兵后，你会打出大量金色随从并触发许多发现效果，这两者都能很好地配合 [[Hooktusk, Master Marauder||132925]]。利用无限经济购买带有发现效果的卡牌，不断提升阵容强度。进阶玩家：转型为上限更高的恶魔酒馆强化流。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + Infinite gold"
msgstr "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + 无限铸币"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]"
msgstr "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Use infinite money to scale pirates"
msgstr "使用无限铸币来提升海盗属性"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Demons - APM Shop Buff"
msgstr "恶魔 - 手速商店强化"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "You must have an insane amount of economy to go for this comp. This is usually achieved with a turn 9 Brann + Rogers + Privateer. When you have too much economy, you will buy all targeted spells to use on [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] to scale the shop. You may also buff the shop cycling bloom gem buffers and buying every gem barrage card. You'll also generate a ton of spells by being infinite, allowing [[Felboar||110664]] or [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]] to eat a huge shop over and over again. Brann and Escapee are additional tools to be infinite."
msgstr "想玩这套流派，必须拥有极其夸张的经济。通常需要在第 9 回合组成布莱恩·铜须、空军上将罗杰斯和骄傲的私掠者的组合。当经济严重溢出时，买下所有能够指定目标的法术，并将其用于 [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] 和 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]，以强化酒馆。你也可以反复买卖能够获取鲜血宝石弹幕的随从，并买下所有“鲜血宝石弹幕”相关卡牌，持续强化酒馆。无限经济还会生成大量法术，使 [[Felboar||110664]] 或 [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]] 能够反复吞食属性极高的酒馆随从。布莱恩·铜须和上进的逃兵则是帮助你实现无限循环的额外组件。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Early infinite gold + Felboar"
msgstr "早期无限铸币 + 邪能野猪人"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Cast spells to consume buffed shop."
msgstr "施放法术法术吞噬酒馆。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Undead - APM Undead"
msgstr "亡灵 - 手速"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] combined with [[Proud Privateer||122520]] gives you lots of gold to hit more of your setup.  Additional cards that help you become infinite include [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] and [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]], but can be cut once you commit more undeads to your board. Cycle every single free card ([[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]) so you stay infinite. After you're infinite, scale undead attack using bounties + [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]. Run a reborn golden [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] to be strong. Also use [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] and cycle every single destroy undead effect such as [[Maw Caster||121508]] and [[Disguised Graverobber||104610]] to destroy reborns and give snazzy permanent stats."
msgstr "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 与 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 的组合可以提供大量铸币，帮助你找到更多阵容组件。其他可以帮助你实现无限循环的卡牌包括 [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] 和 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]，但当你确定在场上投入更多亡灵后，可以将它们替换掉。循环使用所有免费卡牌（[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]），以维持无限循环。实现无限循环后，利用悬赏令和 [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]] 提高亡灵的攻击力。使用一张金色且具有复生的 [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] 来保证阵容强度。此外，使用 [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]]，并循环使用 [[Maw Caster||121508]] 和 [[Disguised Graverobber||104610]] 等所有能够消灭亡灵的效果，消灭具有复生的亡灵，让时尚魅影永久获得属性。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Bounty Generation ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]) + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]"
msgstr "悬赏令生成器 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]) + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"
msgstr "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Scale undead attack with infinite gold"
msgstr "利用无限经济提高亡灵的攻击力"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Undead - Attack Scaling"
msgstr "亡灵 - 攻击提升"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Scale the attack of your Undeads and summons with the Butchering spell from [[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]. Butchering spell improves with spell scaling from [[Friendly Geist||120219]]. Your quality of summons come from [[Handless Forsaken||95265]]. [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] provides a ton of attack and health to your right most unit in combat, but also during the shop phase. Start using Butchering spells on your reborn cards with [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] on board to capture permanent stats. The best variation of this comp is to run [[Dead Bellringer||132322]] + [[Mummifier||108992]] to first reborn your entire board. Then, with a full hand of butchering and also Snazzy, use bellringer activate on the mummifier, then the bellringer will get reborn, and then butcher the bellringer, and repeat for all your butchering spells. This'll give you an insane amount of Snazzy procs."
msgstr "使用 [[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]] 生成的“宰割”法术，提高亡灵及其召唤物的攻击力。[[Friendly Geist||120219]] 提供的法术成长可以进一步强化“宰割”，而 [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] 则负责提供优质召唤物。[[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] 能在战斗阶段和酒馆阶段为最右边的随从提供大量攻击力和生命值。场上有 [[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] 时，开始对具有复生的随从使用“宰割”，从而获得永久属性。这套阵容最强的变体是使用 [[Dead Bellringer||132322]] 和 [[Mummifier||108992]]，先让整个场面都获得复生。随后，在手中存满“宰割”且场上拥有时尚魅影时，让丧钟死灵对木乃伊工匠发动效果。木乃伊工匠被消灭后，丧钟死灵会获得复生。接着对丧钟死灵使用“宰割，并用手中所有“宰割”重复这一过程，从而大量触发时尚魅影。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Attack Scaling ([[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]) + summons ([[Handless Forsaken||95265]])"
msgstr "攻击成长 ([[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]) + 亡灵召唤([[Handless Forsaken||95265]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "[[Deathly Striker||115610]] \n"
"Undead midgame ([[Plaguerunner||126451]])"
msgstr "[[Deathly Striker||115610]] \n"
"亡灵中期过度 ([[Plaguerunner||126451]])"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Summon high attack Undeads"
msgstr "召唤高攻击力的亡灵"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "Dragons - Battlecries"
msgstr "龙 - 战吼"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] gives all of your dragons +4/4 every single battlecry you play. You want to trigger as many battlecries as possible. After you have your setup, cycle only PREMIUM battlecries, such as [[Tavern Tempest||64077]], [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]], [[Shell Collector||80740]] or [[Draconic Warden||126860]]. The highest cap is to find as many double attack spell every turn, and permanently double the attack of warpwing every turn with the help of [[Persistent Poet||108463]]. Additionally, permanently attach divine shield with [[Amber Guardian||95006]] and permanently attach Windfury on Warpwing with [[Thousandth Paper Drake||108116]]."
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 与 [[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] 的组合，可以让你的所有龙在每次触发战吼时获得 +4/+4。你的目标是尽可能多地触发战吼。阵容成型后，只循环使用优质战吼随从，例如 [[Tavern Tempest||64077]]、[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]、[[Shell Collector||80740]] 或 [[Draconic Warden||126860]]。这套阵容的最高上限，是每回合尽可能多地找到能够使攻击力翻倍的法术，并借助 [[Persistent Poet||108463]]，永久保留折跃之翼每回合翻倍后的攻击力。此外，还可以利用 [[Amber Guardian||95006]] 为折跃之翼永久保留圣盾，并利用 [[Thousandth Paper Drake||108116]] 为其永久保留风怒。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr "[[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Bronze Timewalker||132955]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Bronze Timewalker||132955]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "Cycle battlecries to scale dragons"
msgstr "循环使用战吼来强化龙的属性"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Beasts - Beetles"
msgstr "野兽 - 甲虫"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "With early [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] or [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]], start scaling the stats of beetles. [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] can help you generate pieces of the comp with the help of [[Snarky Shark||132804]]. Run as many [[Banana Slamma||98824]] as possible, as they double the attack of your beetles and helps deals with high HP boards."
msgstr "前期获得 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]] 后，开始提高甲虫的属性。[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] 可以配合 [[Snarky Shark||132804]]，帮助你生成阵容所需的组件。尽可能多地使用 [[Banana Slamma||98824]]，它们可以使甲虫的攻击力翻倍，帮助你应对高生命值阵容。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Early [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] or [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"
msgstr "早期 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Summon large beetles"
msgstr "召唤大甲虫"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Quilboar - Choose One"
msgstr "野猪人 - 抉择"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "First, have gem scaling, most commonly through [[Gem rat||116434]] but could be with [[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]. [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]] is the payoff for your gem scaling. It helps to have some choose one generation through [[Gem Rat||116434]] or [[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]. Additionally, cycle every decent choose one card (anything besides [[Intrepid Botanist||120223]] or [[Time Management||117573]])."
msgstr "首先建立鲜血宝石成长，最常见的方式是使用 [[Gem rat||116434]]，也可以通过 [[Sanguine Refiner||122566]] 实现。[[Turbo Hogrider||116195]] 是鲜血宝石成长体系的核心收益随从。最好能通过 [[Gem Rat||116434]] 或 [[Bramble Tunneler||132632]] 获取一些抉择牌。此外，应当循环使用所有效果尚可的抉择牌（[[Intrepid Botanist||120223]] 和 [[Time Management||117573]] 除外）。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "[[Gem rat||116434]] + [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]"
msgstr "[[Gem Rat||116434]] + [[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "[[Gem Rat||116434]]"
msgstr "[[Gem Rat||116434]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Play Choose One cards to scale"
msgstr "打出抉择卡来成长"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beasts - Leviathan"
msgstr "野兽 - 深潜巨兽"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Summon as many beasts as possible after you get early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]]. The best beast summoner is reborned [[Sewer lord||130996]]. Hoarding Hyena summons a taunt summon which is the next best. Then, paired with [[Banana Slamma||98824]], every summon will have a ton of attack."
msgstr "尽早获得 [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] 后，尽可能多地召唤野兽。最好的野兽召唤组件是获得了复生的 [[Sewer lord||130996]]。其次是囤食土狼，它可以召唤一个具有嘲讽的随从。搭配 [[Banana Slamma||98824]] 后，每个召唤出来的随从都能获得大量攻击力。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Early [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + Beast summons ([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"
msgstr "早期获得[[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + 野兽召唤([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Beast summons midgame (beetles)"
msgstr "野兽召唤中期过度（甲虫）"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Make huge attack summons"
msgstr "做出巨大的召唤物"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Mechs - Magnetics/Spells"
msgstr "机械 - 磁力/法术"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Put targetted spells on mechs as much as possible with [[Glambot||132893]] on board. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles the effect. Best to have spell generation such as [[Captain Cookie||133075]]. Cycle good gem cards such as [[Fearless Foodie||113154]] and buy good spells such as 3 pointy arrow spell. Eventually, buy [[Utility Drone||98588]] to capitalize on the magnetics you attached with Glambot in the midgame."
msgstr "场上有 [[Glambot||132893]] 时，尽可能多地对机械使用定向法术。[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 可以使这些法术的效果触发两次。最好拥有 [[Captain Cookie||133075]] 之类的法术生成组件。反复使用 [[Fearless Foodie||113154]] 等优质鲜血宝石卡牌，并购买“武器锻造”等优质法术来获取3张尖利箭矢。最后购买 [[Utility Drone||98588]]，利用中期通过微光机器人磁力吸附的大量组件获得进一步成长。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "[[Glambot||132893]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]"
msgstr "[[Glambot||132893]] + [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "[[Glambot||132893]] to stabilize"
msgstr "用 [[Glambot||132893]] 稳定下来"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/91/
msgid "Cast spells on Mechs"
msgstr "对机械施放法术"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "Demons - Self Damage"
msgstr "恶魔 - 自伤"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "The idea of this comp is to use effects such as [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]], [[Wrath Weaver||59670]], or trinkets to deal damage to your hero, and [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] to negate this damage. [[Tichondrius||99228]] is some payoff for self damage, and used to stabilize in the midgame. Cupcakes generation with [[Eredar Escapist||133028]] is your main payoff for the lategame, targetting [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] to buff your shop. [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] doubles the effect of both Cupcakes and [[Devilish Distractor||132901]]. With [[Wrath Weaver||59670]], every single Demon played makes your next spell free which generates a ton of value. The best demon generation is from [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] and cycling [[Imposing Percussionist||99232]]."
msgstr "这个流派的思路是利用 [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]]、[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] 或饰品等效果对自己的英雄造成伤害，再通过 [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] 回溯这些伤害。[[Tichondrius||99228]] 能从自残中获得收益，并帮助你在中期稳住场面。[[Eredar Escapist||133028]] 生成的腐化糕点是后期的主要收益手段，将腐化糕点用于 [[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] 来强化酒馆。[[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] 可以使腐化糕点和 [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] 的效果触发两次。拥有 [[Wrath Weaver||59670]] 后，每使用一张恶魔牌都会使你的下一张法术牌变为免费，从而创造大量价值。最好的恶魔生成方式是使用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]，并循环使用 [[Imposing Percussionist||99232]]。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "[[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] + self damage ([[Wrath Weaver||59670]] or [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]]) + payoff ([[Tichondrius||99228]] or [[Eredar Escapist||133028]])"
msgstr "[[Ashen Corruptor||121687]] + 自伤效果（[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] 或 [[Malchezaar, Prince of Dance||99199]]）+ 核心收益组件（[[Tichondrius||99228]] 或 [[Eredar Escapist||133028]]）"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] + [[Soul Rewinder||100949]] demon midgame"
msgstr "[[Wrath Weaver||59670]] + [[Soul Rewinder||100949]] 恶魔中期过度"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/13/
msgid "Use self-damage to scale"
msgstr "利用自伤提升属性"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Demons - Shop Buff"
msgstr "恶魔 - 商店强化"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale your shop with [[Devilish Distractor||132901]], best when paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]. Then, your payoff for the buffed shop is most commonly [[Felboar||110664]], but it could also be [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]] and/or reborn [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]. Use [[Methodical Madness||132903]] spells on shops with Divine shield or Venomous to give these keywords to all your demons."
msgstr "使用 [[Devilish Distractor||132901]] 强化酒馆，最好搭配 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]，让强化效果触发两次。酒馆获得大量强化后，最常见的收益组件是 [[Felboar||110664]]，也可以使用 [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]，或者获得了复生的 [[Imp-lusionist||132899]]。对酒馆中具有圣盾或剧毒的随从使用 [[Methodical Madness||132903]] 生成的法术，让你的所有恶魔获得这些关键词。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Buffed Shop ([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr "强化的商店([[Devilish Distractor||132901]]) + [[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Twisted Wrathguard||130662]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/41/
msgid "Scale and consume shop"
msgstr "强化并吞噬商店"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "Beasts - Summons"
msgstr "野兽 - 召唤"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "First, have [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] in the midgame to start generating many beasts and along the way, generate the core pieces to this comp. Then, proc [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]] during shop phase with the help of [[Deathstrider||132808]]. [[Titus Rivendare||97408]] also doubles the effectiveness of this strategy. Force your Gryphon to attack using [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]] activate or cycling [[Snarky Shark||132804]]. Best case is when you chain shop attacks by generating more Lionfish and Sharks. Then, use [[Sewer Lord||130996]] and [[Banana Slamma||98824]] to benefit from the aura from Goldrinn and summon huge attack beasts."
msgstr "首先，在中期拿到 [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]，开始生成大量野兽，并在此过程中集齐这个流派的核心组件。然后，借助 [[Deathstrider||132808]] 在酒馆招募阶段触发 [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]]。[[Titus Rivendare||97408]] 还能使这套策略的效果翻倍。利用 [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]] 的发动效果或循环使用 [[Snarky Shark||132804]]，迫使猎头狮鹫攻击。最理想的情况是生成更多深潜狮子鱼和尖利的鲨鱼，让酒馆招募阶段的攻击连续触发。最后，使用 [[Sewer Lord||130996]] 和 [[Banana Slamma||98824]]，利用巨狼戈德林的光环效果召唤拥有巨额攻击力的野兽。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]] + [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]] + [[Goldrinn, the Great Wolf||59955]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/12/
msgid "Scale summoned beasts in combat"
msgstr "在战斗中召唤强化的野兽"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Beasts - Tasty Lobstah"
msgstr "野兽 - 美味龙虾"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Trigger [[Tasty Lobster||132796]] deathrattle as many times as possible. This is done with multiple rallies + [[Deathstrider||132808]] and [[Titus Rivendare||97408]], triggering Lobster deathrattle upon every rally. Trigger the lobster deathrattle during shop phase using golden [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] and buying every [[Snarky Shark||132804]] and [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]]. Reborn taunt your lobster, and then windfury your Gryphon with [[Sprightly Scarab||108909]]."
msgstr "尽可能多地触发 [[Tasty Lobster||132796]] 的亡语。通过多次触发进击，并配合 [[Deathstrider||132808]] 和 [[Titus Rivendare||97408]]，让每次进击都能触发美味龙虾的亡语。在酒馆阶段，使用金色 [[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] 触发美味龙虾的亡语，并买下所有 [[Snarky Shark||132804]] 和 [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]]。让美味龙虾获得复生和嘲讽，再使用 [[Sprightly Scarab||108909]] 让猎头狮鹫获得风怒。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]]"
msgstr "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] + [[Deathstrider||132808]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/87/
msgid "Trigger Lobster Deathrattle to scale"
msgstr "触发龙虾亡语以成长"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "Murlocs - Tidecaller"
msgstr "鱼人 - 萨满招潮者"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "First, have a ton of economy, typically starting from golden [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] or Brann + [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]], remembering premium economy spells such as Cloning Conch or Battlecry Discovery. Then, your payoff card for all that economy is [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]. Paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]], play as many spells on the tidecaller as possible, which could be bloodgems or [[Oozeling Gladiator||103670]] spells. Scale premium murlocs in hand such as [[Bile Spitter||122219]] and [[Expert Aviator||126637]] so you can summon them and also [[Choral Mrrrglr||98948]] can capture all of the stats of the murlocs in your hand."
msgstr "首先，你需要拥有大量经济资源，通常从金色 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]，或铜须配合 [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]] 开始。同时要留意克隆海螺或战吼发现等优质经济法术。接下来，利用这些经济资源取得核心收益的卡牌是 [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]。配合 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]]，尽可能对潮汐召唤者使用更多法术，例如鲜血宝石或 [[Oozeling Gladiator||103670]] 生成的法术。强化手牌中的优质鱼人，例如 [[Bile Spitter||122219]] 和 [[Expert Aviator||126637]]。这样既可以在战斗中召唤它们，也能让 [[Choral Mrrrglr||98948]] 获得你手牌中所有鱼人的属性值。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + lots of economy + [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 大量经济 + [[Shamanic Tidecaller|||133026]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Shamanic Tidecaller|||133026]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid "Play spells to scale Murlocs."
msgstr "释放酒馆法术扩大鱼人的属性。"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "Elementals - Unbound Tempest"
msgstr "元素 - 无羁雷暴"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "Buff the shop with either [[Nomi, Kitchen Nightmare||63626]] or [[Air Revenant||126173]], whichever method you find first. Use [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Tavern Tempest||64077]] + [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] for massive economy and elemental generation. You may use [[Flaming Enforcer||126924]] to stabilize in the midgame, and [[Unbound Tempest||132983]] to cap out your scaling. With tempest, cycle premium elementals such as [[Sellemental||64038]] and [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]."
msgstr "使用 [[Nomi, Kitchen Nightmare||63626]] 或 [[Air Revenant||126173]] 强化酒馆，优先采用最先找到的方式。利用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]、[[Tavern Tempest||64077]] 和 [[Kelp Keeper||132883]] 的组合获得大量经济并生成元素。中期可以使用 [[Flaming Enforcer||126924]] 稳住场面，后期则利用 [[Unbound Tempest||132983]] 将成长提升到最高上限。拥有无羁雷暴后，循环使用 [[Sellemental||64038]] 和 [[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]] 等优质元素。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + shop buff ([[Nomi, Kitchen Nightmare||63626]]) + [[Unbound Tempest||132983]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 商店强化 ([[Nomi, Kitchen Nightmare||63626]]) + [[Unbound Tempest||132983]]"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Tavern Tempest||64077]] + [[Kelp Keeper||132883]]"
msgstr "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Tavern Tempest||64077]] + [[Kelp Keeper||132883]]"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/92/
msgid "Play elementals to scale from big shop"
msgstr "打出元素随从来强化商店"

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Murlocs - Venom Scam"
msgstr "鱼人 - 下毒"

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Buy all the scam cards and try to preserve placements by killing as many units as possible. Keep your strongest units on the board (that's why you want to concentrate stats!) and fill the rest of the board with units that may be able to trade 1 for 1. Aim to golden [[Expert Aviator||126637]] and give it venom using [[Bile Spitter||122219]]. Then, the Aviator will pull many scam units from your hand. Could give murlocs permanent Venom using [[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]] as well."
msgstr "购买所有的下毒单卡，尽可能多杀一些随从以保住排名。保留你最强战力的卡牌（所以你才需要集中精力研究统计数据！），用可以各种能1换1的随从填充空余棋盘。目标是金色的[[Expert Aviator||126637]] 并通过 [[Bile Spitter||122219]] 给它上毒。然后飞行专家会把你手牌中的下毒卡拉到场上。也能用 [[Sky-hatch Runaway||132957]] 给鱼人永久施加烈毒。"

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "When you have no future or are clearly getting outstatted"
msgstr "当你觉得没有未来或明显快被淘汰时"

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Getting outscaled"
msgstr "快被淘汰了"

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/8/
msgid "Buy scam cards and try to preserve placements"
msgstr "购买下毒卡牌，试图吃烂分"

